<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61248" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κώλ-ῡμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hindrance</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί γὰρ ἐμπόδιον
				κ. ἔτι μοι</span>; <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				862
			</span></i> (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. θεῶν ἢ ἡρώων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					5.30
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βασιλικὸν κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PFrankf.</u>
					1.100
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωλύματα καὶ βλάβαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					9.9
				</span></i>
			: c.inf., <i>hindrance against</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅμαξα κ. οὖσα προσθεῖναι [τὰς
			πύλας</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.67
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωλύματα μὴ αὐξηθῆναι [τὸ
				Ἑλληνικόν</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.16
			</span></i>: c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. φορᾶς</span>
			<i>impediment</i> to motion, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				418e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνεργείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ocell.
					4.12
				</span></i>
			: c. dat., [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ αἵματι</span>]
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Flat.</u>
				8
			</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. καὶ σίνος πρὸς εὐκαρπίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					2.7.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>defence against</i> a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σβεστήρια κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.53
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. δηλητηρίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					1.17.10
				</span></i>
			.</div>
